          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c3_second_develops_practical_kernel_com",
          "text": "Second, it develops a practical kernel that compares the normalized input gradients of the true label across training data, keeping computation linear in the number of samples.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "second",
            "develops",
            "practical",
            "kernel",
            "compares",
            "normalized",
