          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c4_third_proposes_principled_way_choose",
          "text": "Third, it proposes a principled way to choose the kernel lengthscales using the principal components of the data, which lets FoRDE emphasize high-variance features and become especially robust to input corruptions.",
          "expected_role": "content",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "third",
            "proposes",
            "principled",
            "way",
